 104: **Stay with A.** B is 260 g heavier, 12 times softer in normal use, and cracks across the layers at the window corners in a side fall. Total shoulder deflection would go from about 0.08 to about 0.29 mm. A smaller window would help B but costs access. Printing stays better suited to brackets, covers and the shell.
