  31: The earlier x-ray check reported 15 mm or more to the gusset plates. This row-by-row check includes the frame and plate corners, which are the tight spots.
  32: 
  33: **Fix (generator params `bd=10&bdlo=10&nlo=1.0&wlo=4`):** back 10 mm deeper, 20 mm deeper at the frame bottom; bottom of the chest
